Article 2 (Establishment of Standing Subcommittees)
Each Standing Committee under Article 37 of the National Assembly Act (excluding the Intelligence Committee) shall establish standing subcommittees as follows:

1. House Steering Committee
(a) National Assembly Subcommittee;
(b) International Cooperation Subcommittee;
(c) Planning and Budget Subcommittee.

2. Legislation and Judiciary Committee
(a) Legal Affairs Subcommittee;
(b) Legislation and Audit Subcommittee;
(c) Judiciary Subcommittee.

3. Political Affairs Committee
(a) Government Coordination Subcommittee;
(b) Fair Trade Subcommittee;
(c) Financial Supervision Subcommittee.

4. Finance and Economy Committee
(a) Economic Policy Subcommittee;
(b) Taxation Subcommittee;
(c) Finance Subcommittee.

5. Unification, Foreign Affairs and Trade Committee
(a) Unification Subcommittee;
(b) Foreign Affairs Subcommittee;
(c) Trade Subcommittee.

6. National Defense Committee
(a) Military Policy Subcommittee;
(b) Military Manpower Affairs Subcommittee;
(c) Defense Capability Improvement Subcommittee.

7. Government Administration and Home Affairs Committee
(a) Election Management Subcommittee;
(b) Administration and Local Autonomy Subcommittee;
(c) Public Security Administration Subcommittee.

8. Education Committee
(a) Educational Autonomy Subcommittee;
(b) Higher Education Subcommittee;
(c) Education Reform Subcommittee.

9. Science, Technology, Information and Telecommunications Committee
(a) Science and Technology Subcommittee;
(b) Information and Telecommunications Subcommittee;
(c) Meteorology Subcommittee.

10. Culture and Tourism Committee
(a) Culture and Arts Subcommittee;
(b) Sports, Youth and Tourism Subcommittee;
(c) Newspapers and Broadcasting Subcommittee.

11. Agriculture, Forestry, Maritime Affairs and Fisheries Committee
(a) Agriculture and Forestry Subcommittee;
(b) Maritime Affairs and Fisheries Subcommittee;
(c) Cooperatives Subcommittee.

12. Industry and Resources Committee
(a) Industry and Trade Subcommittee;
(b) Resources Subcommittee;
(c) Small and Medium Enterprises Subcommittee.

13. Health and Welfare Committee
(a) Health and Medical Services Subcommittee;
(b) Social Welfare Subcommittee;
(c) Food and Drug Safety Subcommittee.

14. Environment and Labor Committee
(a) Environment Subcommittee;
(b) International Environmental Conventions Subcommittee;
(c) Labor Subcommittee.

15. Construction and Transportation Committee
(a) Construction Subcommittee;
(b) National Land Planning and Water Resources Subcommittee;
(c) Transportation Subcommittee.
